You are producing the **subcomponent architecture document** for a
single leaf inside a UI collection — a specific rendering piece (a
variant, a shared sub-part). This is the final articulation layer
before implementation. Your `<public-surface>` is what sibling leaves
and the collection's own consumers see; your `<technical-
specification>` is what `impl_ui` will build against.

