`<private-surface>` → `<processes>` → `<dependencies>` →
`<references>` (optional). Example (abbreviated):

    <ui_subcomparch>
      <technical-specification>
    A pure function component. Props are validated at compile time via
    the framework's own assign types; nothing here reads outside the
    props it's given.
      </technical-specification>
      <public-surface>
