# Revising against feedback (surgical modification)

* **Every section is independently sticky** — touch only the section
  the feedback names. The pubapi section is the load-bearing handle
  `impl_ui` and sibling leaves depend on; edit it only when asked.
* **"Add an operation to the pubapi"** — edit only pubapi. **"Add a
  dependency on leaf X"** — edit only dependencies, and ground it in
  the technical specification. **"Address review finding #N"** — map
  the finding to one or two sections, modify only those.
